# The title's Load Game by the hand (Rerac-vr's pointer.rs, saves.rs): past the logos to the main menu, the hand
# off the panel until it is there, with a card holding a save in its third slot only (pointer14's). The hand
# on Load Game, then down the slots: the trigger on the empty first does nothing, on the third loads it.
100 hand_pitch 45
900 a 1
906 a 0
1500 a 1
1506 a 0
1900 hand_pitch 16.5
1960 shot on-load
1980 right_trigger 1
1986 right_trigger 0
2400 shot load-page
2420 hand_yaw 29
2420 hand_pitch 27.2
2480 shot slot0
2500 right_trigger 1
2506 right_trigger 0
2600 shot empty-pressed
2620 hand_pitch 8.6
2680 shot slot2
2700 right_trigger 1
2706 right_trigger 0
2900 shot after-load
3400 shot later
4400 shot in-level
4420 quit 0
